            <title>[LU-20550] sanity-lfsck test_24 el10: .lustre/lost+found/MDT0000/ should not be empty</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20550</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Andreas Dilger &amp;lt;adilger@dilger.ca&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/c4383ebc-c46b-4ef8-9016-f0e689124a88" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/c4383ebc-c46b-4ef8-9016-f0e689124a88&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_24 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;(11) .lustre/lost+found/MDT0000/ should not be empty
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/128479" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/128479&lt;/a&gt; - 6.12.0-124.56.1.el10_1.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/128479" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/128479&lt;/a&gt; - 6.12.0-124.56.1.el10_1_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It looks like this has been failing quite a lot, exclusively on el10, but does not have any ticket. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It may relate to the dirdata patch &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/66840" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/66840&lt;/a&gt; ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20424" title="osd_fid_unpack() unexpected packed fid size: 0" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20424"&gt;LU-20424&lt;/a&gt; ldiskfs: save dirdata in ext4_htree_store_dirent") patch that just lasted. &lt;/p&gt;





&lt;p&gt;VVVVVVV DO NOT REMOVE LINES BELOW, Added by Maloo for auto-association VVVVVVV&lt;br/&gt;
sanity-lfsck test_24 - (11) .lustre/lost+found/MDT0000/ should not be empty&lt;/p&gt;</description>
